Cc: Davidlohr Bueso <dave@stgolabs.net>
Cc: Zhang Qilong <zhangqilong3@huawei.com>
Cc: linux-usb@vger.kernel.org
Reviewed-by: "Gustavo A. R. Silva" <gustavoars@kernel.org>
